  generation?: number /* min: 0, max: 9007199254740991 */;
  /** Free-form answer text. When it is absent or blank, text is used in its place. It may be empty when text or answers carries the answer. For a frame_request of kind view, send a JSON-encoded object with v: 1 and status: published, awaiting_approval, dismissed, stopped, gap, failed or busy. issues and notes are arrays of objects with string code and message fields, never arrays of strings; use [] when empty. The optional view object uses id (a non-empty string), title (string) and placed (boolean). The tool keeps at most five entries per array and truncates each string to 400 Unicode code points. An unreadable answer becomes status failed with issue code answer_unrecognized in event.tool_result. HTTP 200 with resolved.outcome answered acknowledges consumption of the answer, not successful parsing or View creation. */
  answer?: string;
